        },
        {
          "token": "[[p13]]",
          "text": "-x"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p14]]",
          "text": "-s"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p15]]",
          "text": "-u"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p16]]",
          "text": "file ..."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0006",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "DESCRIPTION",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "[[p0]] compiles the given files, or standard input if none are listed, into a single output script. Files may be plain text or other compiled scripts. The options are as follows:",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "osacompile"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0008",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]] [[p1]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-l"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "language"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Override the language for any plain text files. Normally, plain text files are compiled as AppleScript.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0010",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]] [[p1]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-e"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "command"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Enter one line of a script. Script commands given via [[p0]] are prepended to the normal source, if any. Multiple [[p1]] options may be given to build up a multi-line script. Because most scripts use characters that are special to many shell programs (e.g., AppleScript uses single and double quote marks, “(”, “)”, and “*”), the command will have to be correctly quoted and escaped to get it past the shell intact.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-e"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "-e"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0012",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]] [[p1]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-o"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "name"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Place the output in the file [[p0]]. If [[p1]] is not specified, the resulting script is placed in the file “a.scpt”. The value of [[p2]] partly determines the output file format; see below.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "name"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "-o"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "text": "-o"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0014",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-x"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Save the resulting script as execute-only.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The following options are only relevant when creating a new bundled applet or droplet:",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0017",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-s"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Stay-open applet.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0019",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-u"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Use startup screen.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The following options control the packaging of the output file. You should only need them for compatibility with classic Mac OS or for custom file formats.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0022",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-d"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Place the resulting script in the data fork of the output file. This is the default.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0024",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]] [[p1]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-r"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "type:id"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Place the resulting script in the resource fork of the output file, in the specified resource.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0026",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]] [[p1]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-t"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "type"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Set the output file type to [[p0]], where [[p1]] is a four-character code. If this option is not specified, the creator code will not be set.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "type"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "type"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0028",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]] [[p1]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-c"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "creator"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Set the output file creator to [[p0]], where [[p1]] is a four-character code. If this option is not specified, the creator code will not be set.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "creator"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "creator"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "If no options are specified, [[p0]] produces a Mac OS X format script file: data fork only, with no type or creator code.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "osacompile"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "If the [[p0]] option is specified and the file does not already exist, [[p1]] uses the filename extension to determine what type of file to create. If the filename ends with “.app”, it creates a bundled applet or droplet. If the filename ends with “.scptd”, it creates a bundled compiled script. Otherwise, it creates a flat file with the script data placed according to the values of the [[p2]] and [[p3]] options.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-o"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "osacompile"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "text": "-d"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p3]]",
          "text": "-r"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "EXAMPLES",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "To produce a script compatible with classic Mac OS:",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "osacompile -r scpt:128 -t osas -c ToyS example.applescript"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0035",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "SEE ALSO",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "[[p0]], [[p1]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "osascript(1)"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "osalang(1)"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
